@startuml US_3_2_1_Auth
title US 3.2.1 - Autenticação via IAM (OIDC + PKCE)

actor User
participant SPA as "SPA (Layout/Login)"
participant API as "AuthTestController"
participant IAM as "IAM Provider (OIDC)"

User -> SPA: Acede /dashboard (não autenticado)
SPA -> API: GET /authtest/me
API --> SPA: 401 (no cookie)
SPA -> API: GET /authtest/login (redirect)
API -> IAM: Authorization Code + PKCE
IAM --> API: code + tokens
API -> User: Set auth cookie; redirect https://localhost:4200/?auth=ok
SPA -> API: GET /authtest/me (withCredentials)
API --> SPA: {name,email,picture,roles,access_token}
SPA -> User: UI autenticada

@enduml
